{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10167","headline":"登楚州城望驿路十余里山村竹林相次交映 · 李嘉佑","name":"登楚州城望驿路十余里山村竹林相次交映","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十里山村道，千峰栎树林。\n霜浓竹枝亚，岁晚荻花深。\n草市多樵客，渔家足水禽。\n幽居虽可羡，无那子牟心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}